```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Cliente Web
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Pred as Prediction Service
    participant ML as Modelo ML<br/>(joblib)
    participant DB as prediction-db

    Client->>Gateway: POST /prediccion<br/>{features...}
    Gateway->>Gateway: Verificar CORS<br/>Validar schema
    Gateway->>Pred: Proxy request
    Pred->>ML: Cargar pipeline<br/>new_workflow.joblib
    ML->>ML: Inferencia<br/>pipeline.predict()
    ML-->>Pred: Probabilidad + Clase
    Pred->>DB: Almacenar predicción
    DB-->>Pred: Confirmación
    Pred-->>Gateway: PlatformPrediction<br/>Response
    Gateway-->>Client: {probability, class...}

    Note over Client: Respuesta en <3s<br/>UMBRAL=0.5

    Client->>Gateway: POST /prediccion/explain<br/>{method: SHAP}
    Gateway->>Pred: Proxy request<br/>(include_narrative=true)
    Pred->>ML: SHAP explanation
    ML-->>Pred: Feature contributions
    Pred->>Pred: Generar narrativa (stub)
    Pred-->>Gateway: PlatformExplanation<br/>Response
    Gateway-->>Client: {rows, narrative...}
```
